---
import { img } from "../../lib/img";
import SectionHeading from "../ui/SectionHeading.astro";
---

<section class="mx-auto w-full max-w-6xl px-4 py-24 sm:py-32">
  <div class="grid items-center gap-14 lg:grid-cols-2 lg:gap-20">
    <div class="relative" data-reveal>
      <img src={img("about-sejarah", 800, 1000)} alt="Historic building of Museum Aceh" loading="lazy" class="w-full object-cover" />
      <img
        src={img("about-detail", 400, 300)}
        alt=""
        loading="lazy"
        class="absolute -right-4 -bottom-10 hidden w-48 border-8 border-cream object-cover shadow-xl sm:block lg:-right-10"
      />
    </div>
    <div>
      <SectionHeading
        eyebrow="Our story"
        title="A museum born from history itself"
      />
      <p data-reveal class="mt-8 leading-relaxed text-coal/70">
        Museum Aceh opened in 1915 as a pavilion of ethnographic objects under
        the Dutch colonial administration. Over a century later it stands as the
        keeper of Acehnese memory — surviving conflict, occupation and the 2004
        tsunami, and reopening stronger each time.
      </p>
      <p data-reveal class="mt-5 leading-relaxed text-coal/70">
        Today the museum cares for more than 2,400 artifacts and welcomes
        visitors from all over the world to experience the story of a people
        known as <em>Serambi Mekkah</em> — the Veranda of Mecca.
      </p>
      <dl class="mt-10 grid grid-cols-2 gap-8" data-reveal-stagger>
        <div>
          <dt class="font-montserrat text-xs uppercase tracking-[0.25em] text-taupe">Founded</dt>
          <dd class="mt-2 font-cinzel text-3xl">1915</dd>
        </div>
        <div>
          <dt class="font-montserrat text-xs uppercase tracking-[0.25em] text-taupe">Rebuilt after tsunami</dt>
          <dd class="mt-2 font-cinzel text-3xl">2007</dd>
        </div>
      </dl>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
